{
    "chapter_num": 32,
    "verses_count": 32,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Esau Comes to Meet Jacob"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jacob went on his way, and the angels of God met him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Jacob saw them, he said, “This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God’s camp.” And he called the name of that place "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Double Camp"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Mahanaim."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jacob sent messengers before him to Esau his brother in the land of Seir, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. field"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "country of Edom. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he commanded them, saying, “Speak thus to my lord Esau, ‘Thus your servant Jacob says: “I have dwelt with Laban and stayed there until now. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I have oxen, donkeys, flocks, and male and female servants; and I have sent to tell my lord, that I may find favor in your sight.” ’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the messengers returned to Jacob, saying, “We came to your brother Esau, and he also is coming to meet you, and four hundred men "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jacob was greatly afraid and distressed; and he divided the people that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him, and the flocks and herds and camels, into two companies. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said, “If Esau comes to the one company and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. strikes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "attacks it, then the other company which is left will escape.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jacob said, “O God of my father Abraham and God of my father Isaac, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who said to me, ‘Return to your country and to your family, and I will deal well with you’: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I am not worthy of the least of all the mercies and of all the truth which You have shown Your servant; for I crossed over this Jordan with my staff, and now I have become two companies. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Deliver me, I pray, from the hand of my brother, from the hand of Esau; for I fear him, lest he come and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. strike"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "attack me "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the mother with the children. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For You said, ‘I will surely treat you well, and make your descendants as the sand of the sea, which cannot be numbered for multitude.’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he lodged there that same night, and took what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "he had received"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "came to his hand as a present for Esau his brother: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "two hundred female goats and twenty male goats, two hundred ewes and twenty rams, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "thirty milk camels with their colts, forty cows and ten bulls, twenty female donkeys and ten foals. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he delivered "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the hand of his servants, every drove by itself, and said to his servants, “Pass over before me, and put some distance between successive droves.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he commanded the first one, saying, “When Esau my brother meets you and asks you, saying, ‘To whom do you belong, and where are you going? Whose "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " these in front of you?’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then you shall say, ‘They "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your servant Jacob’s. It "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a present sent to my lord Esau; and behold, he also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " behind us.’ ” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he commanded the second, the third, and all who followed the droves, saying, “In this manner you shall speak to Esau when you find him; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and also say, ‘Behold, your servant Jacob "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " behind us.’ ” For he said, “I will appease him with the present that goes before me, and afterward I will see his face; perhaps he will accept me.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the present went on over before him, but he himself lodged that night in the camp."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Wrestling with God"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he arose that night and took his two wives, his two female servants, and his eleven sons, and crossed over the ford of Jabbok. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He took them, sent them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "across"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "over the brook, and sent over what he had. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jacob was left alone; and a Man wrestled with him until the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "dawn"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "breaking of day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when He saw that He did not prevail against him, He "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "struck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "touched the socket of his hip; and the socket of Jacob’s hip was out of joint as He wrestled with him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said, “Let Me go, for the day breaks.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But he said, “I will not let You go unless You bless me!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So He said to him, “What "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your name?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He said, “Jacob.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said, “Your name shall no longer be called Jacob, but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Prince with God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Israel; for you have struggled with God and with men, and have prevailed.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jacob asked, saying, “Tell "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Your name, I pray.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said, “Why "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you ask about My name?” And He blessed him there."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jacob called the name of the place "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Face of God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Peniel: “For I have seen God face to face, and my life is preserved.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Just as he crossed over "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Face of God; same as Peniel, v. 30"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Penuel the sun rose on him, and he limped on his hip. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore to this day the children of Israel do not eat the muscle that shrank, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the hip socket, because He "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "struck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "touched the socket of Jacob’s hip in the muscle that shrank."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}